<urn:atm:triage:finding/QA-005-AO23>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "QA-005-AO23" ;
  triage:title "ATM-QA-101 guard repair (4d8179319) narrowed forbidden-token scan to a bare literal-line check" ;
  triage:description "The 4d8179319 repair attempt for ATM-QA-101 dropped the previously scoped forbidden-token scan of the PlaintextTest arm body in favor of a bare literal-line presence check. Low risk today (no current regression), but the narrowed guard no longer protects against a future regression reintroducing TLS inspection into that arm. Reported by quality-mgr during QA-2 for PR #967. Fix: restore the scoped forbidden-token scan coverage for the PlaintextTest arm body." ;
